1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:04,010
(Sheldon:)You want me to remove him from the team?
I'm the captain, I can do that.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:09,270
(Penny:)No, no, that's okay. Just let me
talk to him and I'll get back to you.

3
00:00:10,392 --> 00:00:14,312
(Sheldon:)-When are you going to talk to him?
-I don't know.

4
00:00:14,521 --> 00:00:17,561
(Sheldon:)He's in the laundry room now.
Now would be a good time.

5
00:00:17,816 --> 00:00:19,776
(Penny:)You're not gonna leave me
until I do it?

6
00:00:19,985 --> 00:00:22,945
(Sheldon:)Oh, I think we both know
the answer to that question.

7
00:00:29,369 --> 00:00:33,249
(Penny:)-I think we should talk now.
-What? No, it's okay.

8
00:00:33,415 --> 00:00:36,295
We don't have to talk because
there's nothing to talk about.

9
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,840
(Leonard:)-Everything's good.
-Really?

10
00:00:39,004 --> 00:00:40,334
So you didn't get snarky...

11
00:00:40,505 --> 00:00:43,545
...because I said something nice
to a bowl of chili fries?

12
00:00:44,843 --> 00:00:47,133
(Leonard:)All right, maybe I overreacted.

13
00:00:47,304 --> 00:00:50,144
(Leonard:)So we're in two different places,
emotionally. So what?

14
00:00:50,474 --> 00:00:53,184
(Leonard:)And maybe I'm a little ahead of you,
and that's fine.

15
00:00:53,393 --> 00:00:55,733
(Leonard:)In fact, it makes sense,
because let's face it...

16
00:00:55,896 --> 00:01:01,026
(Leonard:)...I've been in this relationship
two years longer than you.

